msgstr "Serce Fre"

#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:177
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This heart-shaped amulet was created in honor of Fre, the goddess of Vita.  It was last carried by D'vorna Life-Toucher, the Healer who travelled through Chedian healing it's inhabitants for exorborant prices.  He was found stealing from the house of a rich merchant in Thjorgard, and was put to death.  This ring was taken from him as payment for the things he stole. (Effects: +50 to HP, -10 SP; of regeneration)"
msgid ""
"This heart-shaped amulet was created in honor of Fre, the goddess of Vita.  It was last carried by D'vorna Life-Toucher, the Healer who travelled through Chedian healing its inhabitants for exorbitant prices.  He was found stealing from the house of a rich merchant in Thjorgard, and was put to death.  This amulet was taken from him as payment for the things he stole. (Effects: +30 Endurance, +100 HP, -20 SP, regenerates HP)"
msgstr ""
"Ten amulet w kształcie serca stworzono na cześć Fre, bogini Vity. Ostatnio nosił go D'vorna Dotyk Życia, uzdrowiciel, który przemierzał Chedian i leczył jego mieszkańców za wygórowane ceny. Przyłapano go na kradzieży w domu bogatego kupca w Thjorgardzie i stracono. Klejnot odebrano mu jako zapłatę za skradzione rzeczy. (Efekty: +50 PŻ, -10 PM; regeneracji)"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/data_tables/items.txt:178
msgid ""
"During the Rise of the Old Ursanian Empire, there were great Gladiatorial Games held in honor of the current Emperor's feast-day. The greatest Gladiator of those games was honored with a set of armor and weapon. When he wore this prize all would know his greatness and would probably decide not to mess with him as well. Usable by Mercenary and Gladiator only. (Effects: +2 Body Building, +4 Armsmaster (+40 to hit with complete set))"
msgstr ""
"W czasach rozkwitu Starego Imperium Ursańskiego na cześć święta panującego cesarza odbywały się wielkie igrzyska gladiatorów. Najwspanialszego gladiatora tych igrzysk nagradzano zbroją i bronią. Gdy nosił tę nagrodę, wszyscy znali jego wielkość i zapewne woleli z nim nie zadzierać. Tylko dla Najemnika i Gladiatora. (Efekty: +2 do Atletyki, +4 do Walki bronią (+40 do trafienia z kompletem))"

