# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC10.rude:4
msgid "Alright.  Goodbye."
msgstr "Dobrze.  Do widzenia."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC10.rude:5
msgid "Anything else you can tell me about them?"
msgstr "Możesz nam powiedzieć o nich coś więcej?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC10.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC10.rude:6
msgid ""
"If you're so interested, why don't you go ask a member?  They're more than happy to tell you all about themselves."
msgstr ""
"Skoro tak was to ciekawi, to może zapytacie któregoś z nich?  Z wielką radością wszystko wam o sobie opowiedzą."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC10.rude:6
msgid "Very funny.  Anything else you can tell us about them?"
msgstr "Bardzo śmieszne.  Możesz nam powiedzieć o nich coś więcej?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC10.rude:7
msgid "Tell me more about them."
msgstr "Opowiedz nam o nich więcej."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC10.rude:7
msgid ""
"They prefer to be called Honk Worshippers, or Honkers rather than Honkies.  I've seen them get right honked off when they're called that.  HAW! HAW!"
msgstr ""
"Wolą, żeby nazywać ich czcicielami Honka albo Honkerami, a nie honkowcami.  Nieraz się wściekle rozhonkowują, kiedy ktoś ich tak nazwie.  HA! HA!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC10.rude:8
msgid "Honkies?  Who are they?"
msgstr "Honkowcy?  A kto to taki?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC10.rude:8
msgid ""
"They are worshippers of the Temple of Honk.  They worship something called The Great Honk."
msgstr "To wyznawcy Świątyni Honka.  Czczą coś, co nazywają Wielkim Honkiem."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC10.rude:9
msgid "Here ya go!  Pleasant shopping"
msgstr "Proszę bardzo!  Miłych zakupów"

