#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/anskramkeep.lua:416
msgid ""
"Memorandum to all Soldiers\n"
"\n"
"The Drangheim threat has not been abated.  We need to keep to our watches in case they rise up again.  Just because we've sent General Ivsar's army out to meet the Drangheim army does not guarantee that we'll be successful.  Anyone caught sleeping on duty will receive a public beating from me personally!\n"
"\n"
"Captain Wilhem"
msgstr ""
"Rozkaz do wszystkich żołnierzy\n"
"\n"
"Zagrożenie ze strony Drangheim nie minęło. Musimy pilnować wart na wypadek, gdyby znów powstali. To, że wysłaliśmy armię generała Ivsara na spotkanie armii Drangheim, wcale nie gwarantuje nam powodzenia. Każdy przyłapany na spaniu na służbie zostanie przeze mnie osobiście publicznie wychłostany!\n"
"\n"
"Kapitan Wilhem"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/anskramkeep.lua:417
msgid ""
"Letter to Captain\n"
"\n"
"Captain Wilhem,\n"
"As you know, I was ordered to bunk with Sergeant \"Stinky\" Wilans.  I beg that you have a shred of mercy in your soul and order my sleeping arrangements to be reassigned.  I will even sleep in the storage room!\n"
"\n"
"Corporal Smit"
msgstr ""
"List do kapitana\n"
"\n"
"Kapitanie Wilhem,\n"
