# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/sturmfordcity.lua:259
msgid ""
"Letter to Skallgrim\n"
"\n"
"Skallgrim,\n"
"I've seen you come home late and drunk for the last time.  I've taken up with your brother Janir.  At least he takes me with him when he goes out drinking!  Maybe we'll see you at the wedding.\n"
"Cicilia"
msgstr ""
"List do Skallgrima\n"
"\n"
"Skallgrimie,\n"
"po raz ostatni widziałam, jak wracasz do domu późno i pijany. Związałam się z twoim bratem Janirem. On przynajmniej zabiera mnie ze sobą, kiedy idzie na popijawę! Może zobaczymy się na weselu.\n"
"Cicilia"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/events/maps/sturmfordcity.lua:273
msgid ""
"Letter to Children\n"
"\n"
"To My Children,\n"
"I've gone to earn some money to stop us from starving.  Fear not, I shall return soon.\n"
"Hatlati"
msgstr ""
"List do dzieci\n"
"\n"
"Moje dzieci,\n"
"poszedłem zarobić trochę pieniędzy, żebyśmy nie umarli z głodu. Nie bójcie się, wkrótce wrócę.\n"
"Hatlati"

